# C06 knowledge-review writer — manage attach stays closed

Issue: https://github.com/liboyang42-cpu/chengyin-remote-ops/issues/5
Repo: github.com/liboyang42-cpu/chengyin-ios
Branch: cursor/c06-knowledge-review-writer-e504
Base: cursor/c06-theme-draft-idea-body-e504 @ 2d4345987e1f84f913c3e64d12e575aa66533723

`MerchantNPCKnowledgeReviewWriter` implements `MerchantNPCOriginalReviewPublishing`.
This is the contract being written, not a route discovered in the supplied sources.
`submitForOriginalReview` POSTs the four draft fields and the given request id to
`api/merchant/npc/knowledge-review` on the held https APIConfiguration, with the
logged-in member token in the Authorization header. The token is not placed in the URL.
It returns a ticket only when the response requestId equals the submitted id and the
member matches. Otherwise it throws the existing waitingSource failure and does not publish.
It does not mint a second id. A missing review permission does not publish. A nil approval
does not publish.

`publishApproved` throws waitingSource for `MerchantNpcKnowledgeDraftService.http`
and does not send a publish request.

This writer does not call `POST api/ai/theme/draft`. It does not call
`POST api/merchant/npc/save` or `api/merchant/npc/save/result`. It does not call
merchant authoring generate/createDraft. It does not wrap `MerchantNPCOriginalDraftWriter`.
The paired read on the contract being written is
`GET api/merchant/npc/knowledge-review/request?requestId=`. This writer does not call it.

The character page stays the existing character fields. The manage page stays
`MerchantOperationsDocumentView`. This hunk does not replace either page.

## Not applied

Giving this writer the running transport needs the session. That attach is only
the paste below. Do not apply it. Do not edit:

